{"id":"u-78dd023f-4afe-4d35-ae34-1152cf3d53f8","src":"community","title":"Easy Hypertrophy (Beta Testing)","author":"Mace Starwalk","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/5EB3ip-restart","desc":"Short and simple 45-75 minute (approx 10 set) workouts, for hypertrophy.\n\nThe program focuses on basic movements to make the most efficient use of time. All major muscle groups are worked at least once, but emphasis is placed on the most aesthetic muscles.\n\nThis program alternates between focusing on high weight and high reps, to ensure all the fast-twitch and slow-twitch muscle fibres are activated (no fibre left behind).\n\nThe program suggests a minimum of 4 workout days per week, with 3 unspecified optional rest days. All 3 'rest-days' can be skipped, at user's discretion, for accelerated progress. You may even choose to use one of these extra days to focus on some of the more neglected muscle groups, like those poor baby cows you're ashamed to make eye-contact with.\n\nMake sure to allow extra time, the first time you do this workout, so you can figure out how much weight you need to reach your rep targets.\n\nMake sure to go slow on the eccentric, and to pause for 2 seconds at the bottom of every rep (this trick will ensure you still get maximised results despite the low number of sets).\n\nI recommend resting 60 seconds between sets.","level":["Novice","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength","Bodybuilding","Muscle & Sculpting"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":16,"rate":5,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-07-20T17:44:37.471Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Chest","Shoulders","Back/Biceps","Legs"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":10,"pct":60,"x":10}]},{"n":"Dip (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":0,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Push Up","sets":[{"sec":180,"rpe":10}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"pct":60,"x":10}]},{"n":"Upright Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"pct":60,"x":10}]},{"n":"Shrug (Du